{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><figcaption>郭奕芯向來樣靚身材正 ，擁有33C豐滿上圍。</figcaption></figure><p>現年 30 歲的性感女神郭奕芯（ Ashina ）向來樣靚身材正 ，擁有 33C 豐滿上圍，更從不吝嗇展示美好身段。近日，她在社交網派軍糧，上載了一輯在酒店房間拍攝的內衣寫真，火辣程度爆燈。</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-10/1058034/block/singleImage/3236238/df/01M4QRMQ5F9MNX5JVH7R8YMSP0.jpg?updatedAt=1791799613\"/><figcaption>郭奕芯以一套黑白色簡約內衣上陣。</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-10/1058034/block/singleImage/3236239/df/01M4QRNH20HS5SSB99D2TQM4X9.jpg?updatedAt=1791799613\"/><figcaption>郭奕芯雖然外披一件白色針織薄外套，卻無阻她大晒其驕人身材。</figcaption></figure><p>誘惑 撩人 相中所見，郭奕芯以一套黑白色簡約內衣上陣，雖然外披一件白色針織薄外套，卻無阻她大晒其驕人身材。內衣剪裁性感火辣，其豐滿上圍表露無遺，深長事業線兼 螞蟻纖腰 更是搶盡眼球。她在房內擺出多個誘人姿勢，一時咬手指、 一時跪坐床上拉低外套， 眼神相當撩人。帖文一出，狂吸逾8千個Like，不少網民留言表示：「流晒鼻血」、「黃蜂肚，曱甴腰！」、「引死人」、「性感女神」。</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-10/1058034/block/singleImage/3236241/df/01M4QRS0TGY1A83AV3SKVJBQMT.jpg?updatedAt=1791799613\"/><figcaption>內衣剪裁性感火辣，令郭奕芯豐滿上圍表露無遺。</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-10/1058034/block/singleImage/3236242/df/01M4QRNH20HS5SSB99D2TQM4X9.jpg?updatedAt=1791799613\"/><figcaption>郭奕芯雖然外披一件白色針織薄外套，卻無阻她大晒其驕人身材。</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-10/1058034/block/singleImage/3236243/df/01M4QRSNYVDXN6TJ8GMQY9NJHE.jpg?updatedAt=1791799613\"/><figcaption>郭奕芯在酒店房內擺出多個誘人姿勢。</figcaption></figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-10/1058034/block/singleImage/3236244/df/01M4QRT54RPNFCB7AHKFNWMDT2.jpg?updatedAt=1791799613\"/><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-10/1058034/block/singleImage/3236245/df/01M4QRV631SQ1TWHTGV6JYW93K.jpg?updatedAt=1791799613\"/></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-12T15:19:45.242573+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":423,"images":7,"source":"am730","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-12T14:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-12T19:38:07.398525+00:00","content_updated_a